    <!-- AboutWindow -->
    <system:String x:Key="Str_AppVersion">Version {0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_AboutDescription">A desktop application to manage world clocks and alarms with real time-zone precision, designed for people who work or communicate across different time zones.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_Features">FEATURES</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureClocksTitle">Customizable world clocks</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureClocksDesc">Add, edit, and remove clocks for any time zone, with search by city and favorites pinned to the top of the list.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureAlarmsTitle">Cross-timezone alarms</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureAlarmsDesc">Create alarms in any time zone you choose, with optional notes and links, a real-time countdown, and color urgency indicators (green, orange, red).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureActionsTitle">Attend, snooze, or dismiss</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureActionsDesc">When an alarm fires, decide whether you attended it, snooze it for extra time, or mark it as missed.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureHistoryTitle">Complete history</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureHistoryDesc">Review every past alarm with its final state, filter, sort, export to JSON/CSV, and reuse previous alarms to quickly create new ones.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureNotifCenterTitle">Notification center</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureNotifCenterDesc">Alerts for upcoming alarms and time zone database status, with an unread badge, category filters, and a taskbar counter.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureTzdbTitle">Up-to-date time accuracy</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_FeatureTzdbDesc">The time zone database (TZDB) updates automatically in the background to reflect daylight saving changes and each country's rules.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorks">HOW IT WORKS</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorksStep1">1. Add the clocks for the cities you care about from the main panel.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorksStep2">2. Create an alarm by choosing the time zone, time, notes, and an optional link.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorksStep3">3. The app will automatically calculate the countdown and notify you when it's about to ring.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorksStep4">4. When the alarm rings, decide whether to mark it attended, snooze it, or dismiss it.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HowItWorksStep5">5. Check the History to see the outcome of all your previous alarms.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_Technology">TECHNOLOGY</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_TechnologyDesc">Built with .NET and WPF, using NodaTime for time zone calculations based on the IANA database (TZDB).</system:String>

